team_id_home	Unique ID for the home team.
team_abbreviation_home	Short abbreviation (e.g., "LAL").
team_name_home	Full name of the home team.
matchup_home	Shows matchup info (e.g., "LAL vs BOS").
wl_home	Win ("W") or Loss ("L") for home team.
min	Total minutes played (usually 240 in regulation).
fgm_home	Field Goals Made.
fga_home	Field Goals Attempted.
fg_pct_home	Field Goal Percentage.
fg3m_home	3-Point Field Goals Made.
fg3a_home	3-Point Field Goals Attempted.
fg3_pct_home	3-Point FG Percentage.
ftm_home	Free Throws Made.
fta_home	Free Throws Attempted.
ft_pct_home	Free Throw Percentage.
oreb_home	Offensive Rebounds.
dreb_home	Defensive Rebounds.
reb_home	Total Rebounds.
ast_home	Assists.
stl_home	Steals.
blk_home	Blocks.
tov_home	Turnovers.
pf_home	Personal Fouls.
pts_home	Total Points Scored.
plus_minus_home	Plus/Minus value when the player/team was on the court.
video_available_home	1 if video of the game is available, 0 if not.